Note on PySide6 / Qt (LGPL)
===========================

Qt for Python is used as a dynamically linked library, without
modification. The Schémaja source code can be run with any compatible
version of PySide6 installed by the user:

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    py gui.py

The Qt for Python source code and its license text are available at the
addresses listed above.
